### Orders (needs accessToken, storeId; place an order first via http/storefront.http)

@base = http://localhost:8080
@orderId = PASTE_ORDER_ID

### List (filters: status, financialStatus, fulfillmentStatus; q = #number or email prefix)
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders?financialStatus=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Detail with timeline
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark as paid (cash / bank transfer): sells the reserved stock
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/manual-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"note": "bank transfer ref 4711"}

### Fulfil (only paid orders)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/fulfillment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel (unpaid orders, or paid orders after a full refund): releases reserved stock
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "customer_request"}


### Ship part of the order with tracking (P13). Omit "lines" to ship everything remaining
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": [{"variantId": "PASTE_VARIANT_ID", "quantity": 1}], "carrier": "DHL", "trackingNumber": "JD000123"}

> {% client.global.set("shipmentId", response.body.id); %}

### Shipments of the order
GET {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark delivered
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/delivery
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cancel a shipment still in transit (its quantities can be shipped again; the order reopens)
POST {{base}}/admin/v1/stores/{{storeId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/cancellation
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
